WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.736
[music playing]

00:00:15.115 --> 00:00:18.017
GEORGE ANASTASIA: The Italian
American Mob of Philadelphia

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:20.253
was Philadelphia-based,
but it had tentacles

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:22.922
into southern New
Jersey as Far East

00:00:22.989 --> 00:00:24.491
as the Atlantic City resort.

00:00:27.727 --> 00:00:32.132
LOU PICHINI: In the late
70s where legalized gambling

00:00:32.198 --> 00:00:35.568
came to Atlantic City,
this was like a treasure

00:00:35.635 --> 00:00:36.936
trove for the mob.

00:00:45.378 --> 00:00:48.314
JIMMY D: Atlantic City
went from a ghetto

00:00:48.381 --> 00:00:53.019
to a very powerful Union city.

00:00:53.086 --> 00:00:56.556
The Bartenders Union, the
Waitress Union, the Linen

00:00:56.623 --> 00:01:04.664
Union, the Philadelphia
mob with Scarfo

00:01:04.731 --> 00:01:07.066
wanted to own those
unions because then you

00:01:07.133 --> 00:01:09.736
could go to the casino
presidents and tell them

00:01:09.803 --> 00:01:13.239
we're going to have a strike
unless you kick up the us

00:01:13.306 --> 00:01:16.843
x amount of dollars annually.

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:18.378
It was big money.

00:01:30.323 --> 00:01:33.860
John McCullough
was a union leader.

00:01:33.927 --> 00:01:38.865
McCullough took control of
the unions in Atlantic City,

00:01:38.932 --> 00:01:42.969
and he wouldn't go along
with any of the mob's plans

00:01:43.036 --> 00:01:44.304
of working with them.

00:01:46.739 --> 00:01:48.308
GEORGE MARTORANO:
John McCullough

00:01:48.374 --> 00:01:53.646
made the mistake in getting
his eyes on Atlantic City.

00:01:53.713 --> 00:01:56.983
All's I know he was told to
keep out of Atlantic City.

00:01:57.050 --> 00:02:00.286
He should have listened.

00:02:00.353 --> 00:02:05.391
LOU PICHINI: Scarfo
goes to Long John,

00:02:05.458 --> 00:02:07.627
wants to set up McCullough.

00:02:07.694 --> 00:02:09.596
You do the murder.

00:02:09.662 --> 00:02:12.665
Long John's going to willingly
accept that because this is how

00:02:12.732 --> 00:02:15.401
he's going to prove
himself with respect

00:02:15.468 --> 00:02:17.370
to becoming a mob member.

00:02:24.077 --> 00:02:25.345
- People don't realize.

00:02:25.411 --> 00:02:27.080
It takes a lot of
balls to walk up

00:02:27.146 --> 00:02:28.781
put up a gun to someone's head.

00:02:39.459 --> 00:02:44.797
I met Long John, and he said
you got balls like an elephant.

00:02:44.864 --> 00:02:48.868
Basically, we got a
piece of work to do.

00:02:48.935 --> 00:02:50.837
I want you to do it.

00:02:50.904 --> 00:02:53.473
Do a murder.

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:57.076
With the guy that's
right next to the boss,

00:02:57.143 --> 00:02:59.879
it's an honor to be asked.

00:02:59.946 --> 00:03:01.414
And I said, all
right, no problem.

00:03:09.589 --> 00:03:12.025
Got a box of flowers, so
I could leave the piece

00:03:12.091 --> 00:03:14.193
and the silencer in there.

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:17.764
Trying to be like a
dump delivery guy.

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:21.668
We arranged to meet about
5 o'clock that night.

00:03:21.734 --> 00:03:25.004
Long John, I think he had
his gold Lincoln that day.

00:03:25.071 --> 00:03:28.241
I got in the back
nodded, at each other,

00:03:28.308 --> 00:03:31.678
we proceeded over the
Benjamin Franklin Bridge

00:03:31.744 --> 00:03:34.247
heading towards
Northeast Philadelphia.

00:03:44.557 --> 00:03:46.426
Long John pointed out the house.

00:03:50.463 --> 00:03:53.032
He turned around
and sat a couple

00:03:53.099 --> 00:03:54.767
of houses down in his car.

00:03:58.137 --> 00:03:59.939
I got out with the flowers.

00:04:05.511 --> 00:04:09.082
I went up and
knocked on the door.

00:04:09.148 --> 00:04:11.184
And as soon as John
answered the door,

00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:13.152
he looked at me just like
you're looking at me,

00:04:13.219 --> 00:04:15.455
and I just put the silencer
up to his forehead.

00:04:18.491 --> 00:04:20.827
It was over and that was that.

00:04:33.306 --> 00:04:36.275
Long John said, man, I
love you, I love you.

00:04:36.342 --> 00:04:38.978
Handed me $5,000 in
cash said, listen,

00:04:39.045 --> 00:04:41.581
buy yourself some suits.

00:04:41.648 --> 00:04:43.549
- 60-year-old
McCullough was gunned

00:04:43.616 --> 00:04:45.518
down nine days before
Christmas in his

00:04:45.585 --> 00:04:47.086
Northeast Philadelphia home.

00:04:47.153 --> 00:04:51.057
LOU PICHINI: The delivery man
kills him in front of his wife.

00:04:51.124 --> 00:04:53.826
People were just
absolutely stunned by that.

00:04:53.893 --> 00:04:57.730
You wonder what is the
darkness of the individual

00:04:57.797 --> 00:04:59.298
who's a member of the mob.

00:05:08.408 --> 00:05:11.310
- Long John got made and
became an initiated member

00:05:11.377 --> 00:05:12.445
because of that hit.

00:05:15.948 --> 00:05:19.318
He was worthy of being
part of the organization.

00:05:24.991 --> 00:05:28.528
JIMMY D: He became Scarfo's
number one man on the street.

00:05:40.540 --> 00:05:45.311
Long John definitely wanted
to control the whole business

00:05:45.378 --> 00:05:48.881
of meth in every aspect.

00:05:48.948 --> 00:05:52.452
Someone won't
cooperate, kill 'em.

00:05:52.518 --> 00:05:55.855
We'll just take over
his whole operation.

